            "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> German language only –</li></ul>Rocky Beach will become the scene of a top-secret Hollywood action movie series plotted around a league of super heroes acting as spies. But suddenly, the main character has disappeared without a trace, along with his secret super hero suit. <br><br>When Peter‘s father – who is in charge of the special effects – receives a mysterious message he asks the Three Investigators to get involved. Indeed there are some spies doing their strange job, even in reality…<br><br>Help Jupiter, Peter, and Bob to find the actor – and to prevent the series from being canceled!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A new case for The Three Investigators<br></li><li> Detective adventure including many locations and characters from Rocky Beach<br></li><li> With the voices of Oliver Rohrbeck, Jens Wawrczeck, Andreas Fröhlich, and some more narrators known from The three Investigators audio plays<br></li><li> For players aged 10+</li></ul>",
